  "bodyHtml": "\n\t\n\t<div class=\"col-md-8\">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-image-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-title-date no-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Guild September 23rd General Meeting</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tecset-date\"><span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">September 23, 2023 @ 2:30 pm</span> - <span class=\"tribe-event-time\">4:00 pm</span></div>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-light-bg\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-content-area\">\n\t\t   \t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>The Guild will hold our General Meeting on Saturday, September 23rd at 2:30-4:00pm in the multi-purpose room in the Harwich Community Center, 100 Oak Street. Our featured demonstration artists is Eileen Casey working creatively with watercolor.  The meeting and demonstration is free and open to the public.  <img class=\"size-medium wp-image-6661 alignleft\" src=\"/media/archive/336818c4ed0e821c7ccebe3db63fc32c871ac59adffd02a8141024925587750b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6662\" src=\"/media/archive/112c2c743c644aec872a660ae8be8d816cfbf952a5c3b9adb142aa030e63b38b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-map-area\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"tribe-events-venue-map\">\n\t\n<p data-fidelity-note=\"embed\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed/v1/place?key=AIzaSyDNsicAsP6-VuGtAb1O9riI3oc_NOb7IOU&amp;q=100+Oak+Street+Harwich+MA+02645+United+States+&amp;zoom=10\">Google maps iframe displaying the address to Harwich Community Center</a></p>\n</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"col-md-4\">\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-area\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-sidebar-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-past-event-notice\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-notices\